*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0003
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 215
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0003.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> DEPOSIT TERM IN MONTHS
    05 WS-TRM             PIC 9(3).
       88 TRM-BAND-1-3 VALUE 1 THRU 3.
       88 TRM-BAND-4-18 VALUE 4 THRU 18.
       88 TRM-BAND-19-36 VALUE 19 THRU 36.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-IRT             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SET-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "WS-IRT=" WS-IRT
    STOP RUN.
SET-TERM-RATE.
    *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 1.5 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF TRM-BAND-1-3
        MOVE 0.0275 TO WS-IRT
    ELSE
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 13 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF TRM-BAND-4-18
            MOVE 0.0350 TO WS-IRT
        ELSE
            *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 27 PER 1998 POLICY
            IF TRM-BAND-19-36
                MOVE 0.0425 TO WS-IRT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0150 TO WS-IRT
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
